  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell allows the target to cause the ground to rise up beneath him. As a swift action, the target can cause the ground to rise 5 feet, while all adjacent squares are treated as steep slopes. The groundswell precludes flanking from creatures standing at lower elevations than the target. If the target moves after creating a groundswell, the ground returns to its normal elevation at the end of his turn; otherwise, it remains in place until the target moves or uses a swift action to return the ground to normal. A groundswell cannot increase elevation of the ground beyond 5 feet.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell allows the target to cause the ground to rise up beneath him. as a swift action, the target can cause the ground to rise 5 feet, while all adjacent squares are treated as steep slopes. the groundswell precludes flanking from creatures standing at lower elevations than the target. if the target moves after creating a groundswell, the ground returns to its normal elevation at the end of his turn; otherwise, it remains in place until the target moves or uses a swift action to return the ground to normal. a groundswell cannot increase elevation of the ground beyond 5 feet.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
